\begin_layout Section
Multilayer SPP calculations
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
The equation for SPP excitation in a multilayer system is given by 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
e^{-4k_{1}a}=\frac{\frac{k_{1}}{\varepsilon_{1}}+\frac{k_{2}}{\varepsilon_{2}}}{\frac{k_{1}}{\varepsilon_{1}}-\frac{k_{2}}{\varepsilon_{2}}}\frac{\frac{k_{1}}{\varepsilon_{1}}+\frac{k_{3}}{\varepsilon_{3}}}{\frac{k_{1}}{\varepsilon_{1}}-\frac{k_{3}}{\varepsilon_{3}}}\label{eq:ImplicitEq}
\end{equation}

\end_inset

where 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{equation}
k_{i}^{2}=\beta^{2}-k_{0}^{2}\varepsilon_{i}\label{eq:WaveVectors}
\end{equation}

\end_inset


